"The great undead blight was meant as a challenge, a dungeon for Questors to conquer."
"Years later, in the Blight city, undead fliers the size of great ships are built with magic."
"Later, the Questor Brox smashes an undead blight at Itonia."
"Later, undead behemoths and zombies roam near a mountain monastery of Quaz."
"Later, an undead army and a blight lie outside the city of Ardglass."
"Later, Aarl of the Heirs wields an ax that raises zombies to obey him."
